# Log-triage — bounded absence in an attached log
#
# Regression target: a log can prove a bounded absence such as "no FATAL /
# crash lines" without being converted into repo negative_search or current
# source citations. The answer should still mention the observed warning/info
# scope so the no-hit claim is bounded.
ID="logtri_no_fatal"
NAME="log-triage no fatal negative observation"
QUESTION="这段日志里有没有 FATAL/崩溃错误？如果没有，请说明日志范围内观察到的最高级别问题。"
LOG='2026-05-21T09:00:00Z INFO worker started request_id=req-001
2026-05-21T09:00:01Z WARN cache miss key=session:abc retry=1
2026-05-21T09:00:02Z INFO worker completed request_id=req-001 status=ok
'
EXPECT_MATCHES_REGEX="(没有|未发现|未看到|0).*(FATAL|崩溃)|(FATAL|崩溃).*(没有|未发现|未看到|0)
(WARN|warning|告警|警告)"
